                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Robert was born in a small town in Virginia. He served in the US Army from 1958 to 1962, then worked as a civil engineer for over 40 years. He married Margaret Collins in 1963 and together they raised three children. Robert was known for his dedication to family, his love of woodworking, and his famous barbecue ribs at every family gathering.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.6,
                              "fontFamily": "Inter",
                              "fontSize": 14,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
